{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"akira399/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f1b187231bb9b3db12d00e8b440ac7318612a699","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是面向 DSH Web 的会话管理插件，在侧边栏每个会话的操作菜单中加入“删除对话”入口。用户确认后，客户端调用本地删除路由；主机端通过会话持久化服务定位并删除该会话目录，并清理 workspace 中的会话登记和归档记录。对于正在运行的会话，插件会先尝试取消运行并从内存存储分离。适合需要从 DSH 清理单个旧会话记录的 Web 用户。安装后无需 API Key 或外部账号，依赖 DSH Web 和 Node.js 20 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-203","lib/client.js:217-252","lib/index.js:106-124","lib/index.js:137-204","lib/index.js:215-237"]}
{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"akira399/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f1b187231bb9b3db12d00e8b440ac7318612a699","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-delete adds a Delete session action to DSH Web conversation menus. After confirmation, a local route removes the session directory and clears workspace and archive records. Running sessions are cancelled when possible and detached. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-203","lib/client.js:217-252","lib/index.js:106-124","lib/index.js:137-204","lib/index.js:215-237"]}
