{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-session-delete#feature-1","repo":"akira399/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f1b187231bb9b3db12d00e8b440ac7318612a699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「侧边栏删除入口」：在会话操作菜单的归档项下方加入删除项。用户选择后需确认，再提交删除请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:170-203","lib/client.js:217-241"]}
