{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-session-delete#feature-3","repo":"akira399/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f1b187231bb9b3db12d00e8b440ac7318612a699","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「处理运行中会话」：若目标会话在内存中，删除流程会尝试取消当前运行并调用 store 的 detach，再继续删除持久化目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:149-179"]}
